[KernelSU] Custom Kernel for Realme C3 | Android 15

Device: Realme C3 (RMX2020 / RMX2027)  
Android Version: 15  
Kernel Type: Non-GKI  
Root Solution: KernelSU  
Status: Tested and working  
Build by: @rxtritik & @SZYRYJN

---

### Features:
- KernelSU root (no Magisk needed)  
- Built for non-GKI devices (MT6768)  
- Stable and compatible with Android 15  
- **Modifications in:** `exec.c`, `open.c`, `read_write.c`, `stat.c` & `RMX2020_defconfig`

